{"id": "official:sentence:36b8863c-54fe-4f11-9124-282ea4f1de79", "text": "那台电脑是花三千块买的。", "shortMeaning": "那台电脑三千块买的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd0fe263-4452-4d1c-9694-1dba513bb2c5", "text": "那周末我去滑雪了。", "shortMeaning": "那个周末我去滑雪了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43faf603-0ff1-4123-8a2c-3730daeadcf7", "text": "那国家的气候很严峻。", "shortMeaning": "那个国家气候很恶劣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9695d01b-0c01-4ed1-ac76-37612ccb88fe", "text": "那土豆很烫，把我嘴都烫了。", "shortMeaning": "那土豆太烫，把我嘴烫了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b61b5c19-adda-4ee0-8505-2e239e98eac5", "text": "那在阿拉伯语中代表什么意思？", "shortMeaning": "那在阿拉伯语里指什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0067518-285c-4515-9baf-7dfa256c254f", "text": "那场比赛，我从头看到尾。", "shortMeaning": "那场球我从头看到尾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c31f7ae-e3d3-422c-a4b9-ea0e2558bbd5", "text": "那声音搅了我的美梦。", "shortMeaning": "那声音把我的好梦吵了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f16ee38-f47e-42b0-8ed8-c3bfddc54f8f", "text": "那多山地区还没有高速路。所有货运被驮在人的背上或在马的背上。", "shortMeaning": "那片山区还没高速，货都靠人背马驮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94a4b5fc-e240-495a-90f0-c26078808732", "text": "那天很冷，而且还下起了雨。", "shortMeaning": "那天天冷，还下起了雨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7c436b2-e8fd-486e-8f18-26da7d193901", "text": "那天我丢了我的照相机。", "shortMeaning": "那天我把相机丢了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4aa88955-50d3-411d-90bf-610954fa57ea", "text": "那天晚上一颗星星都看不见。", "shortMeaning": "那晚一颗星也看不见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:50679d35-4352-4900-acbf-a19c3b85fa6b", "text": "那女人比我老很多。", "shortMeaning": "那女人比我大不少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7330f297-95c2-4bfb-8d04-8a531fe03b2d", "text": "那女士容忍了那男人。", "shortMeaning": "那位女士忍下了那个男人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8e921bb-6640-4def-98fc-4bb38e647c25", "text": "那女子反对我们的计划。", "shortMeaning": "那女人不同意我们的计划。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b6f40c3-a8b2-4dba-bab2-e3a37e79ab05", "text": "那女孩的头发上绑了一根黄丝带。", "shortMeaning": "那女孩头发上系了条黄丝带。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:347629df-c238-4857-bfb8-2a86b352a0d2", "text": "那女孩跟我微笑打招呼。", "shortMeaning": "那女孩笑着跟我打招呼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41f2433e-fcff-4ae5-9ab2-a4f1fdd7d0a2", "text": "那如果那是真的呢？", "shortMeaning": "那要是那是真的呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ea42342b-339c-41b5-a50c-62059a513bd0", "text": "那家伙是个车迷，对车特别了解。", "shortMeaning": "那家伙迷车，对车特别懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a93fc23c-ff55-4e85-a6c2-6e5e88a34051", "text": "那家公司去年亏损了10亿日元。", "shortMeaning": "那家公司去年亏了10亿日元。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:691d81bb-701d-4618-9fa3-816f33cd4c21", "text": "那家公司由我的哥哥经营。", "shortMeaning": "那家公司由我哥打理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f969a20-fa1f-4aeb-8485-e3c2a223e2e6", "text": "那家工厂生产玩具。", "shortMeaning": "那家厂做玩具。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:251bfa39-ce18-461c-962c-e76c7b5e56fe", "text": "那家工厂的境况不太好，背了很多债务。", "shortMeaning": "那家厂处境不佳，欠了一堆债。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce803e49-793e-40aa-b4bd-4905bde586ff", "text": "那家店卖报纸和杂志。", "shortMeaning": "那家店卖报和杂志。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:701159cb-0529-49d5-ae8e-ad7b30da1e0f", "text": "那家店有很多客人。", "shortMeaning": "那家店客人很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5651eec-91ba-45a6-b115-226b760007cf", "text": "那家店里的新货全卖光了。", "shortMeaning": "那家店的新货全卖完了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de7e72dd-d953-4acf-acf9-38a6633cc3bd", "text": "那家餐馆每天供应两千道菜。", "shortMeaning": "那家餐馆一天出两千道菜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34f3a1ed-beda-4ee8-806e-f1341faf9dbc", "text": "那家饭馆儿的服务员给我们留下很好的印象。", "shortMeaning": "那家馆子的服务员让我们印象很好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef061210-b6c0-417e-9341-448cf629d045", "text": "那家馆子物美价廉，美中不足的是他们糟糕的位置。", "shortMeaning": "那家馆子菜好价低，就差位置太糟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24ef89e6-44dc-4819-b819-d91f41f8e016", "text": "那封信我写了三次。", "shortMeaning": "那封信我写了三遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c68e8590-057a-42a7-8ccb-d0ee7f687e8d", "text": "那就是他们学英语的办法。", "shortMeaning": "他们学英语就是这么学的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eeb3ffe5-c5b4-4a41-885a-64ff664b5fc7", "text": "那就是她说的东西。", "shortMeaning": "她说的就是这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4113c063-fc70-4e85-9a51-d9f99f80be00", "text": "那就是我不赞同你的计划的原因。", "shortMeaning": "我不赞成你的计划，就为这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c1abb60-434f-4d03-a86c-1bc228f6419c", "text": "那就是那台他用来写文章的电脑。", "shortMeaning": "他写文章用的就是那台电脑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81138f01-6d94-4502-aca0-85e694c4af89", "text": "那就是问题所在了。", "shortMeaning": "问题就在这儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9cebad03-8fc1-4202-abbe-2a358e90f899", "text": "那帮人也和我们一起来了。", "shortMeaning": "那帮人也跟着我们来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:374df1e7-0aaa-4e6e-9f32-a403d3f2b152", "text": "那幅伦勃朗的画是件艺术品。", "shortMeaning": "那幅伦勃朗的画是艺术品。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac833064-f67b-4587-9e9b-4dcf1affc00a", "text": "那幅画有多少年了？", "shortMeaning": "那幅画有多少年头？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba902322-531d-4f91-b5f9-a584202e5990", "text": "那幢房子是砖头造的。", "shortMeaning": "那栋房子是砖砌的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2eddec2e-ec89-4734-a72b-fbd3fb80c8aa", "text": "那幢房子看起来被遗弃了。", "shortMeaning": "那栋房子看着没人住了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58adc3fa-7a91-4ed1-9de8-c83e77fb6f77", "text": "那幢绿色屋顶的建筑是什么？", "shortMeaning": "那栋绿顶的建筑是什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f922ae0-138d-447f-af0d-7e0cb4e49759", "text": "那座桥是罗马人修建的。", "shortMeaning": "那座桥是罗马人造的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a2aa383-00ae-482b-9ffe-6ef82af63d9b", "text": "那座红楼顶的房子是我叔叔的。", "shortMeaning": "那座红顶房子是我叔叔的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:217cc604-cb8e-49d5-ba45-a7940afaa6d1", "text": "那座老桥正面临坍塌的危险。", "shortMeaning": "那座老桥有塌的危险。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df9d32e0-89d0-4b88-8f1b-3e660aecdc29", "text": "那张木椅要多少钱？", "shortMeaning": "那张木椅多少钱？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:769777a1-4456-4b8a-a499-7583d80c961e", "text": "那当然是这里的面筋百叶双档最最地道。", "shortMeaning": "那当然是这儿的双档最地道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c8966ac8-0508-4bb5-9786-e451721c00d5", "text": "那形状美丽的胸脯，甚至因为太端正太美丽，几乎丧失了性的意味。", "shortMeaning": "那胸脯形状好看，就因为太端正太美，几乎没了性的味道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8bba1a39-85c1-49a9-b2c6-039c08d59bd3", "text": "那您随我来一趟，咱们去仓库里找一找，说不定那里会有。", "shortMeaning": "那您跟我来一趟，去仓库找找，说不定有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:89fb4c4e-b154-423d-acaa-970e4714b408", "text": "那我为什么会做呢？", "shortMeaning": "那我又为什么去做？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:407dad68-845a-4b6b-a864-fa68e85e01d0", "text": "那我先去泡澡了哟。", "shortMeaning": "那我先去泡个澡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0234475-38dd-4b57-944c-fdbdc6448500", "text": "那我就不继续打扰你，玩数独游戏去了。", "shortMeaning": "那我就不打扰你了，去玩数独。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91f1f9ab-e4f0-4b51-b968-172a167c92e7", "text": "那我就恭敬不如从命啦。", "shortMeaning": "那我只好听您安排了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a32e381-cd7f-41ea-aec2-dce01e15c18e", "text": "那房子因为其少有的形状被突显出来。", "shortMeaning": "那房子因为形状少见，格外显眼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba71ea71-4592-4914-ac42-e37b8f0e0bed", "text": "那房子是我出生的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我就在那房子里出生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3bfadf1-620a-481a-97a1-2b20bc30439d", "text": "那房子比他那座好得多了。", "shortMeaning": "那房子比他那座好得多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0482a806-2519-4f41-ae21-057b77b2e9cc", "text": "那打破了他所有的梦想。", "shortMeaning": "那把他所有的梦都打碎了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c29f521a-9dad-486f-8c3c-4fdad39f119c", "text": "那把伞跟我在车上发现的是同一把。", "shortMeaning": "那把伞跟我在车上捡的是同一把。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f3c98df-c5f7-40d1-a379-dd39a8a36dd3", "text": "那把吉他太贵了，我买不起。", "shortMeaning": "那把吉他太贵，我买不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb6d22a2-6850-4164-96b9-d361f97c49a6", "text": "那把椅子是皮革做的。", "shortMeaning": "那把椅子是皮的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cb599dc-86d9-4e99-8d49-b1d0fde36c7d", "text": "那把白色阳伞是她的。", "shortMeaning": "那把白阳伞是她的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27a60193-6f96-48c5-87b4-608c892a6906", "text": "那时我没有选择的余地。", "shortMeaning": "那时我没得选。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29164d3b-3fbd-44e9-a596-2bc2facf8632", "text": "那时是那时，现在是现在。", "shortMeaning": "那会儿是那会儿，现在是现在。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:548e19fe-05e7-4b96-b18f-bd86ee419b0d", "text": "那时的盗版商很没有职业道德的。", "shortMeaning": "那时的盗版商一点职业道德都没有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:189d2edd-bffc-42d8-8fd3-0d1aed8e947f", "text": "那时，分队办公室里电话响了。", "shortMeaning": "那时，分队办公室的电话响了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:149b9c1a-bb46-4649-adc2-d11dc9c2e4ae", "text": "那是一个安静的夜晚。", "shortMeaning": "那是个安静的夜晚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa098c89-5c59-49b6-b645-85a437b5b6d8", "text": "那是一个真正的人。", "shortMeaning": "那是个真正的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5252491d-0c02-437a-bc30-c267634b3a23", "text": "那是一个给我们带来无穷乐趣的传奇性的演出。", "shortMeaning": "那场演出很传奇，给我们带来无尽乐趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7044e0a-665a-4c0b-ab40-1fe5a8e3a348", "text": "那是一个静谧的下午。", "shortMeaning": "那是个安静的下午。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ccee6a6-a4cd-45ac-b9b3-031cc5b984a9", "text": "那是一只鹳还是一只苍鹭？", "shortMeaning": "那是鹳还是苍鹭？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d5e5ee7-0f61-4293-9dec-53d26f984d49", "text": "那是一台巨大的电视。", "shortMeaning": "那是台很大的电视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e32e058-7298-48f1-8713-056858a01b5b", "text": "那是一种奇妙的体验。", "shortMeaning": "那是种奇妙的体验。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73151a6b-f2aa-4e8d-bc5f-daabbadc582c", "text": "那是一间兰色的房子。", "shortMeaning": "那是一栋蓝色的房子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61db22f9-9b7b-49a7-9206-b91ac129fa13", "text": "那是世界上最大的都市之一。", "shortMeaning": "那是全球最大的都市之一。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14846270-f7b0-4e38-b3f7-770d43a9dea8", "text": "那是个微妙的局势。", "shortMeaning": "那局面很微妙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0f6e5fb-8dc4-497e-a5ba-4a5ef93d5dfa", "text": "那是个明智的选择。", "shortMeaning": "那是明智的选择。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d09ac9f3-5d24-4169-b43b-ae601c86f637", "text": "那是个漆黑的没有月光的夜晚。", "shortMeaning": "那晚黑得没有月光。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ba6222c-9407-4f21-94a6-3f836e5c64e2", "text": "那是人类第一次在月球上行走。", "shortMeaning": "那是人类头一回在月球上走。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eed69757-1586-485e-98bd-dc00c85d1e7b", "text": "那是他的成名作了。", "shortMeaning": "那是他的成名作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da1f6ec6-89da-4fd8-8e21-088b2ab190d3", "text": "那是住在隔壁的男人。", "shortMeaning": "那是住隔壁的男人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:897e5ffc-20d1-4f11-9806-cdef0c0c9324", "text": "那是值得自豪的事。", "shortMeaning": "那是件值得骄傲的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e2452c0-a838-434b-9fd7-b778f986ac03", "text": "那是另一种方言，你听起来当然奇怪了。", "shortMeaning": "那是另一种方言，你听着当然怪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0563e4f-8c27-4596-a44e-8d703ca6185c", "text": "那是只猫还是只狗？", "shortMeaning": "那是猫还是狗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:be61c62a-4a4a-47b9-96f7-6ef2b926f535", "text": "那是因为你不想孤单宜人。", "shortMeaning": "那是因为你不想孤单。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35fd9f13-a63a-4f65-be31-c0a6855e1116", "text": "那是学英语最好的方法。", "shortMeaning": "那是学英语最好的法子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e05589ee-50a6-4ee4-bc9c-67302c3324f1", "text": "那是幢高楼，不是吗？", "shortMeaning": "那是栋高楼，不是吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37447525-1cdd-4be2-9ff7-641444fa98a7", "text": "那是很久的消息了。", "shortMeaning": "那是很久以前的消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d243637-eb97-4c2f-bcdd-48ae43a4bd6d", "text": "那是我一生中最美好的时光之一。", "shortMeaning": "那是我一辈子最快乐的日子之一。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c8d44ca-574d-42af-98c2-4c0247550d72", "text": "那是我们第一次见面。", "shortMeaning": "那是我们头回见面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ae19bfd-f72b-42d1-9758-19c1ec62a7d9", "text": "那是我在这里的另外一个理由。", "shortMeaning": "那是我待在这儿的另一个理由。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7877d50-14c1-48d3-bad2-ff82fa5b2ba0", "text": "那是我搬到波士顿的原因。", "shortMeaning": "我搬去波士顿就为这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3abf6d86-ac5e-43e9-89c4-08a9da14f564", "text": "那是我爸爸工作的大楼。", "shortMeaning": "那是我爸上班的那栋楼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69be2425-0ef3-4b64-90d5-369c7b9a0176", "text": "那是我生命中最美的一天。", "shortMeaning": "那是我这辈子最美的一天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e0c43329-7c93-432c-8795-69b6a53b8d1c", "text": "那是我说过的最愚蠢的话了。", "shortMeaning": "那是我说过最蠢的话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19a0a342-fc2b-49aa-ada6-4d99704fcc5e", "text": "那是新买的鞋子吗？", "shortMeaning": "那是新买的鞋吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:679d9b35-9786-4bd3-8358-7804030bb894", "text": "那是最重要的一点。", "shortMeaning": "那是最要紧的一点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9fb5cc9e-78f4-49e4-a437-43ccd51f9cf2", "text": "那是谁说的？一派胡言。", "shortMeaning": "谁说的？一派胡言。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04f5f891-30b4-45d6-9c98-acc9c17811c1", "text": "那本书不在桌子上。", "shortMeaning": "那本书不在桌上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5bf42d06-e8a6-46f3-92ea-86e386c3e822", "text": "那本书仍受版权保护。", "shortMeaning": "那本书还受版权保护。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1080656a-2c56-421b-b240-46426c2ad4bc", "text": "那本书含有很多页。", "shortMeaning": "那本书页数很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6146a0e4-7bfc-4c80-9ffa-5bac4ac37ca2", "text": "那本词典分为两卷。", "shortMeaning": "那本词典分两卷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b9d3138-e8ae-43c2-bd59-142ca8a3d88e", "text": "那朵云对我来说像一只兔子。", "shortMeaning": "我看那朵云像只兔子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1fcba2db-54a2-4221-a8ee-858d0a3b89cd", "text": "那条新裙子让她很满意。", "shortMeaning": "那条新裙子她挺满意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7ced4da-a0a8-4129-8e43-65c2466f7564", "text": "那条狗被汽车撞到了。", "shortMeaning": "那条狗让车撞了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2efb214b-68ed-4ad4-8b39-1a0ad215abe0", "text": "那条裙子是不是太短了？", "shortMeaning": "那条裙子是不是太短？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d68be78-81e6-46bc-ab82-f8c15ae156ce", "text": "那条连衣裙很适合您。", "shortMeaning": "那条连衣裙很衬您。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:442b0ae9-f6c3-45fa-8265-6f180d683644", "text": "那条连衣裙真的很适合她。", "shortMeaning": "那条连衣裙真的很衬她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:877cdac4-0a32-4b44-b99f-692601e55643", "text": "那栋建筑是什么呢？", "shortMeaning": "那栋建筑是什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69fa6f12-ae47-4b9b-b1c8-d2e56bc41e38", "text": "那栋灰色的大楼吗？", "shortMeaning": "是那栋灰楼吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f9e3c60a-6b7c-4ad7-975b-2c470aad1929", "text": "那样就够了，不需要再做其他事了。", "shortMeaning": "这样就够了，不用再做别的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:343361c9-6eb0-431e-bab6-409c7cdc50b6", "text": "那样的事天天都有。", "shortMeaning": "那种事天天都有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e0cb625-1ce7-4a58-bb61-52956bc1c1d2", "text": "那样的话，大家就会来教我吧？", "shortMeaning": "那样的话，大家就会来教我了吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7117c461-2c62-4ff5-91fd-20417ebba04e", "text": "那棵树上有很多橙子。", "shortMeaning": "那树上橙子很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:861ed3bd-3d5f-4991-9e6a-27dfbd2e0a9e", "text": "那次聚会她没来，谁也不知道为什么。", "shortMeaning": "那次聚会她没到，谁都不知为什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15c094c8-a247-4248-97e6-c1198439629d", "text": "那沉默就像细细的粉末，悄然漂浮在空中。", "shortMeaning": "那沉默像细粉，悄悄浮在空气里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f997a580-8f50-4b78-95b5-8a64d7f34eb9", "text": "那片云是鱼的形状。", "shortMeaning": "那片云像鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b4a04a8-9baf-4c43-8fb0-f2e8456f9657", "text": "那狗一只眼是瞎的。", "shortMeaning": "那条狗一只眼瞎了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55ff25d3-4cf0-4e7e-9080-06f8e182f083", "text": "那班列车2个小时前出发了。", "shortMeaning": "那趟列车两个小时前开走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:33df1f3a-2645-467f-87a0-4a7a4e833c45", "text": "那男人偷了我的钱包。", "shortMeaning": "我的钱包是那男人偷的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:385ca5fd-d7e4-4ad7-b7c3-a6b767a9533e", "text": "那男人把她推到一旁。", "shortMeaning": "那男人把她推到一边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ae21af2-6354-4c5f-ad19-96517fff2d0b", "text": "那男孩儿来访过我家。", "shortMeaning": "那个男孩到我家来过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01928206-dcef-4362-a3f9-a59161be4787", "text": "那男孩搔了搔耳朵。", "shortMeaning": "那男孩挠了挠耳朵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43611199-ae34-4ec0-ad87-a0f3d30081dd", "text": "那真是糊涂透顶了。", "shortMeaning": "那真是糊涂到家了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8246f32d-93cf-427c-a379-d32b3e177ca3", "text": "那离欧洲有点远，你不觉得吗？", "shortMeaning": "那儿离欧洲有点远，你不觉得？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d3e064c-a066-4d3d-b9bf-5f033c4d4c19", "text": "那种动物靠肉食为生。", "shortMeaning": "那种动物以肉为食。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df35761e-a77d-43cf-8561-54490ac02638", "text": "那种生活方式不适合我。", "shortMeaning": "那种活法不适合我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a027a74-7293-4655-b3ad-5d396e404e80", "text": "那种药救了她的命。", "shortMeaning": "那种药把她救活了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b76577be-bbb5-4c07-9f40-16254c2f3597", "text": "那种鞋子用来登山是不行的。", "shortMeaning": "那种鞋不能用来登山。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:06b43ca6-60f2-44f2-87bf-9d097e339f6c", "text": "那笔钱改变了他的生活。", "shortMeaning": "那笔钱改变了他的日子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e362ca55-d445-4128-be62-ec3362af8471", "text": "那群人打网球打多久了？", "shortMeaning": "那群人打网球打了多久？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf31fe6a-4932-4704-a661-257082cd552b", "text": "那肯定有别的理由，怎么样，被我说中了吧？", "shortMeaning": "那肯定另有原因，怎么样，我说对了吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d734d5b-0948-4d0d-bf37-c10b7648e96c", "text": "那背后是什么意思？", "shortMeaning": "那背后是什么用意？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8250117-c7fb-40ce-90dc-4739774236e0", "text": "那艘船上有多少人？", "shortMeaning": "那条船上有多少人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29c9b897-875e-4317-842c-5113397cec33", "text": "那艘船被放回了海上。", "shortMeaning": "那条船被放回海里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88a2b708-62e0-48df-b1a3-a92bd2baa398", "text": "那苹果从树上掉下来。", "shortMeaning": "那个苹果从树上掉了下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b39274a7-dd89-4684-8496-07f4864daea6", "text": "那解释了为什么门是开着的。", "shortMeaning": "这就说清了门为什么开着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79cf4424-a0cb-4181-947c-8fb9a5fefd2d", "text": "那警察对我的母亲漠不关心。", "shortMeaning": "那个警察对我母亲毫不关心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3615569b-12e0-460b-8154-ea93bdad4435", "text": "那超出了我的理解。", "shortMeaning": "那超出我的理解。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:322824b7-233f-409e-95ad-9a36605b7b7c", "text": "那路当然挺远的，我们打的去算了。", "shortMeaning": "那路挺远，我们打车去吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f02e7bc6-d4a9-4f1e-b98c-970af89ad8da", "text": "那辆山地车多少钱？", "shortMeaning": "那辆山地车什么价？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25a226bf-8658-4709-a083-bd541aa46701", "text": "那辆汽车真的很贵。", "shortMeaning": "那辆车真不便宜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:031728e0-070f-4e79-bbfc-0495e73b5ea0", "text": "那辆油罐车在冒烟！", "shortMeaning": "那辆油罐车冒烟了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:80fbaf32-28fe-4f54-b078-564e748e7e27", "text": "那辆电动车不是我的。", "shortMeaning": "那辆电动车不归我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bfcdf338-0942-40db-976f-a51a2364633d", "text": "那辆红色的汽车撞到了蓝色的卡车。", "shortMeaning": "那辆红车撞上了蓝卡车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f957bcdd-9d69-4116-b6ad-0fe213bf9aa2", "text": "那辆车属于一家博物馆。", "shortMeaning": "那辆车是一家博物馆的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00d9b265-ccba-431e-baa9-577a0bc4ab41", "text": "那辆车是三辆之中最漂亮的。", "shortMeaning": "三辆车里那辆最漂亮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0473173a-e12f-4c68-87c6-8fe513e145ec", "text": "那边的两位女士是谁？", "shortMeaning": "那边两位女士是谁？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffbd6cf9-4e78-40e2-b283-efc1c4fafb13", "text": "那边的报纸，你给他送去。", "shortMeaning": "那边的报纸你给他送去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8cb5ed1-6a4f-4b6e-8d78-08c75249b3f5", "text": "那边的那个女子是安娜。", "shortMeaning": "那边的女子是安娜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:545acfa5-dd72-45c9-b655-a9f385090b4d", "text": "那部叫“鬼影实录”的电影并没那么好。", "shortMeaning": "那部《鬼影实录》没那么好看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de15c5cf-c87c-44db-b526-7d96adec4075", "text": "那部小说我看了三天。", "shortMeaning": "那本小说我看了三天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a46edb08-3c7e-48f2-bbcd-4868f3c43c27", "text": "那部电影值得一看。", "shortMeaning": "那部电影值得看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:334099fb-d1a0-484a-99dc-060f8ae3e5aa", "text": "那部电影很有意思。", "shortMeaning": "那部电影挺有意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:afa65f6c-8f62-4abe-8bd7-ceacfea05062", "text": "那部电影有看的价值。", "shortMeaning": "那部电影值得花时间看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04464133-4ffb-4cbd-a772-12c710ec085c", "text": "那部电影真的很感人。", "shortMeaning": "那部电影真让人感动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61dd0c82-6cdb-49a2-b958-2f58fb6fde17", "text": "那部电影讲述了一场人工智能失控的故事，完美展现了科技惊悚的氛围。", "shortMeaning": "那部片讲人工智能失控，把科技惊悚的味道演得很足。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97b3df48-eadf-4a9c-b5d9-786606a9b2e2", "text": "那里似乎并没有任何出路。只有一个房间接着另一个房间，一个走廊通向另一个走廊。", "shortMeaning": "那里好像没有出口，只有一屋连一屋、一廊接一廊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2e234b1-32ce-4bfa-8b48-4f2bd494f287", "text": "那里就像战场一样。", "shortMeaning": "那里像战场一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9b26d95-d84d-4054-b390-f3dfae9bda3e", "text": "那里展示着各种各样的书。", "shortMeaning": "那儿摆着各式各样的书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b0ed202-a830-4b7c-8420-6b07ab5a8e9e", "text": "那里有八块小圆石。", "shortMeaning": "那儿有八块小圆石。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b8ec059-6441-43db-8f28-576d27d863f6", "text": "那里有许多雏菊围绕着钢铁大厦。", "shortMeaning": "许多雏菊围着那座钢铁大厦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51039436-f1de-43dc-9317-1bc9bf119454", "text": "那面墙摸上去很凉。", "shortMeaning": "那面墙摸着很凉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3570f2f2-0d9b-47b9-8a7f-cbc3bcdc7c64", "text": "那音乐声音十分响。", "shortMeaning": "那音乐声很响。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d782805e-9867-4bc7-af6d-acdfab38a909", "text": "那高个儿女人很漂亮。", "shortMeaning": "那个高个女人很漂亮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d99abfb-613b-4ce4-a785-9a48c779eb71", "text": "那，我们五点后去买衣服，好吗？", "shortMeaning": "那我们五点以后去买衣服，行吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f88e634-9d9e-485e-b059-392bc44bf673", "text": "邮局根据寄信地址将邮件进行分类。", "shortMeaning": "邮局按寄信地址分拣邮件。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7000ca3-37f7-4091-9182-bee084dc9bb0", "text": "邮差送邮件到各个家庭。", "shortMeaning": "邮差把邮件送到各家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a725981-3afd-4565-98b4-1e668e3005e5", "text": "邮递员每天早上都去送信。", "shortMeaning": "邮递员每天早上去送信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:676d1ef1-5c3a-4c5c-af08-d9de61ad7fe1", "text": "邻居们说他们听到了叫喊声。", "shortMeaning": "邻居们说他们听见了喊声。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b02a403d-58f9-474f-871a-fadbb97e51a7", "text": "邻居看见信箱不是空的。", "shortMeaning": "邻居看见信箱里不是空的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec530a62-a102-421b-a184-80f8f8912319", "text": "郁金香将很快盛开。", "shortMeaning": "郁金香很快就要开了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d930b29f-8a08-48e7-b8c3-d7abce646889", "text": "部落成员沿着河岸定居了。", "shortMeaning": "部落的人沿着河岸住下了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:32a804ab-3f28-45ec-a28a-07ec97f24d78", "text": "都市文化对年轻一代来说很有吸引力。", "shortMeaning": "都市文化很吸引年轻人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61c3b7a1-70b0-41a6-8f13-94e7b1ffd956", "text": "都市文化海纳百川，建筑、出版、娱乐、弄堂生活都有上海自己特色。", "shortMeaning": "都市文化包罗万象，建筑、出版、娱乐、弄堂生活都有上海味。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e3b4e75-a666-44ef-b198-100b1cfbeeca", "text": "都很好，都很好，都是能弄到的里面最好的。", "shortMeaning": "都好都好，都是能弄到的最好的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7efe3fe7-1fb7-414a-ab34-a25f5ab091c1", "text": "都看着我干嘛，我脸上有字啊？", "shortMeaning": "都看我干什么，我脸上有字吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:610fd21a-a7d3-4a68-a30f-366344b65baa", "text": "配偶家离（我）老家很近，距离还没到需要打车的程度。", "shortMeaning": "爱人娘家离我老家很近，近得不用打车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed081999-1446-4817-9b7d-7a4caf8bfe8a", "text": "酒后驾车会有危险。", "shortMeaning": "酒后开车有危险。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1eaa10ae-3c65-4093-b2d0-10cac476e9e6", "text": "酒吧里的舞女不性感。", "shortMeaning": "酒吧里跳舞的女郎不够撩人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f00e580d-7fe4-4a4f-a930-921c66117a54", "text": "酒是灌入瓶中的诗。", "shortMeaning": "酒是装进瓶里的诗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b1ca9f1-2363-4dcc-b9be-2f0322670900", "text": "酒的消费每年都在上升。", "shortMeaning": "酒的销量年年上涨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53494112-8e06-4808-95bf-e60f18877c76", "text": "酒被放在桶里发酵。", "shortMeaning": "酒装在桶里发酵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:483dc582-71aa-48c8-9a46-8cbae32600f6", "text": "酒过三杯，男人醉了。", "shortMeaning": "三杯下肚，那男人醉了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9dc7eaf4-e16e-4173-b650-f66d8f69f91c", "text": "酒醉者醒来时处于监狱里了。", "shortMeaning": "醉汉醒来时人在牢里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6036011e-e81c-44ed-a723-342752f445ad", "text": "酒驾是个严重的问题。", "shortMeaning": "酒后开车是个大问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:adf6ce5b-a18a-4022-9a78-a1f12bc1cafd", "text": "酗酒是导致阳痿的一个因素。", "shortMeaning": "酗酒是造成阳痿的一个原因。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efd9c153-9f34-4b0e-992e-c0d196ae7863", "text": "酸会和金属物质起化学反应。", "shortMeaning": "酸会和金属起化学反应。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c768e9c0-33a4-45f0-bedf-9bd1461dd020", "text": "酸性会腐蚀含有金属的物质。", "shortMeaning": "酸性会腐蚀含金属的东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:21cd7361-9b9f-449b-8fd2-d4276984ffe8", "text": "酸雨不是自然现象。", "shortMeaning": "酸雨不是自然形成的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:880b2251-ffdc-4d09-a5d6-69b225cb2320", "text": "酸雨是神殿坍塌的一部分原因。", "shortMeaning": "神殿倒塌，酸雨是原因之一。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f27b61fa-6e8e-4624-bb3b-568837e569af", "text": "里加是拉脱维亚的首都。", "shortMeaning": "拉脱维亚的首都是里加。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14c82f2a-cd2e-47b3-bd79-0363ddf8625f", "text": "里奥· 梅西是世界上最杰出的前锋之一，他是巴塞罗那进球最多的球员。", "shortMeaning": "梅西是世界顶尖前锋之一，也是巴萨进球最多的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77cb3793-e182-4d33-b12d-5a2787ec5b93", "text": "里昂的机器人可以做任何他想要完成的事。", "shortMeaning": "里昂的机器人想干什么都能干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:730cfb53-3d46-493d-bf0d-ca9c46b56bb2", "text": "里约热内卢的一条海边的高架自行车道倒塌了。", "shortMeaning": "里约一条海边高架自行车道塌了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c67a811-2782-4899-b9cb-cf1af93a7fac", "text": "里约热内卢的一条自行车道倒塌了。", "shortMeaning": "里约热内卢有条自行车道塌了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13bf10d9-8aa1-43a6-90f3-3e1b1c918e49", "text": "里面开了一个个欧式的小店，情调好极了！", "shortMeaning": "里面开了不少欧式小店，很有点情调！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9afcf099-5f3f-4c29-a0ab-7da675374b3f", "text": "重力将一切带下地球表面。", "shortMeaning": "重力把万物拉向地面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df7326b5-0095-41ed-a00d-3502ec30560d", "text": "重庆是一座丘陵的城市，道路弯弯曲曲的。", "shortMeaning": "重庆是座山城，路弯弯绕绕。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d3fa628-41c1-448c-bd10-3b52c05c548b", "text": "重新启动你的电脑。", "shortMeaning": "把电脑重启一下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ed60c71-cb35-499a-beb2-757565585f25", "text": "重生题材的小说从2010年左右开始成为中国网络小说的主流。", "shortMeaning": "重生小说从2010年前后成了中国网文主流。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dafe92ac-0035-491c-9391-e56a471fc40e", "text": "重要的是你怎么读，而不是你读什么。", "shortMeaning": "要紧的是怎么读，不是读什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56fa6ebc-fb02-40b6-a62a-361d721a0641", "text": "重要的是你有没有竭尽全力。", "shortMeaning": "要紧的是你有没有拼尽全力。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
